ts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-source-page-renders.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-source-page-renders.readback.md`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-source-page-renders.validator-result.json`\n- `scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-source-page-renders.mjs`\n- `scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-source-page-renders.test.js`\n\n## Render Readback\n\n- Visual-required rows: 858\n- Source page candidates: 1,327\n- Required unique source pages: 1,311\n- Rendered page count: 1,311\n- Missing pages: 0\n- Duplicate reuse count: 16\n- Failure classes: `{}`\n- Renderer: `pdfjs-dist + @napi-rs/canvas`\n- Renderer versions: `pdfjs-dist@5.4.54`, `@napi-rs/canvas@0.1.77`\n- External VLM calls: 0\n- Student-display eligibility changes: 0\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-source-page-renders.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-precise-crop-source-map.test.js` passed: 2 suites, 5 tests.\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-source-page-renders.mjs --check` passed: validation `pass`, 1,311/1,311 rendered files exist, manifest/readback/validator match generated output.\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-source-page-renders.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-source-page-renders.test.js` passed.\n- `npm run lint:changed` passed.\n- `git diff --check` and `git diff --cached --check` passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` passed with expected warnings only for branch naming/branch ahead state; worktree clean.\n","created_at":"2026-07-04T07:14:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T07:35:02Z","closed_at":"2026-07-04T07:35:02Z","merged_at":"2026-07-04T07:35:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"956f30c69e8cc4cdf40e13498efae6276bb0d657","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879